# 1. EXECUTIVE SUMMARY

## 1.1 Product Overview

The project involves developing a modern, easy-to-use, offline-capable Point of Sale (POS) and Business Management Platform designed for small and medium-sized businesses.

The platform will provide a unified business management solution for multiple industries, including:

- Bars and pubs.
- Restaurants and food vendors.
- Cosmetics and beauty shops.
- Provision and grocery stores.
- Pharmacies.
- Supermarkets and mini-marts.
- Fashion and clothing retailers.
- Electronics and accessories retailers.
- General retail businesses.

The application will use a shared platform architecture with configurable industry-specific modules.

Businesses will be able to purchase the software through a one-time licensing arrangement, with optional installation, hosting, maintenance, support and customisation services.

## 1.2 Product Vision

To make professional business management accessible to small businesses through affordable, intuitive and reliable technology.

## 1.3 Product Mission

To simplify business operations by bringing sales, inventory, purchasing, staff management, financial accountability and business reporting into one application.

## 1.4 Core Product Principles

1. Simplicity: The system must be easy to learn and operate.
2. Reliability: Sales must continue during internet interruptions.
3. Accountability: Every important business transaction must be traceable.
4. Security: Business data must remain private and protected.
5. Flexibility: Different industries must be supported without separate applications.
6. Scalability: The architecture must support multiple businesses, branches and terminals.
7. Localisation: The platform must accommodate different African currencies, tax rules and business practices.
8. Maintainability: All installations must be manageable through a controlled release and maintenance process.

